"Fast user switch into the AgentSpace user once (System Settings → Control Center → Fast User Switching), then switch back. The session stays alive afterwards." = "用快速用户切换登录一次 AgentSpace 用户（系统设置 → 控制中心 → 快速用户切换），再切回你自己的账号。此后该会话会一直保持。";
"The AgentSpace desktop is on your physical display right now. Switch back to your own account; input resumes automatically and is refused until then." = "AgentSpace 桌面此刻就在你的物理显示器上。请切回你自己的账号；在此之前输入会被拒绝，切回后自动恢复。";
"Start the preview first (`preview.start`); a stream also stops itself after 10 seconds with no frame pulls." = "请先启动预览（`preview.start`）；流在 10 秒内没有帧拉取时也会自行停止。";
"The AgentSpace session has no window server. Log the AgentSpace user in through the GUI (not ssh) and retry." = "该 AgentSpace 会话没有窗口服务器。请通过图形界面（而非 ssh）登录 AgentSpace 用户后重试。";
"Start the Space's worker: `agentspace start <space>`, or check `agentspace doctor`." = "启动该 Space 的 worker：`agentspace start <space>`，或运行 `agentspace doctor` 检查。";
"The worker refuses to run as root. It must run as the AgentSpace user inside that user's Aqua session." = "worker 拒绝以 root 运行。它必须以 AgentSpace 用户身份在该用户的 Aqua 会话内运行。";
"In the AgentSpace session: System Settings → Privacy & Security → Accessibility → enable agentspace-worker. Then run `agentspace restart <space>`." = "在该 AgentSpace 会话中：系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 辅助功能 → 启用 agentspace-worker。然后运行 `agentspace restart <space>`。";
"In the AgentSpace session: System Settings → Privacy & Security → Screen & System Audio Recording → enable agentspace-worker. Then run `agentspace restart <space>`." = "在该 AgentSpace 会话中：系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 屏幕与系统声音录制 → 启用 agentspace-worker。然后运行 `agentspace restart <space>`。";
"Coordinates are display POINTS (x right, y down, origin top-left of the main display), not screenshot pixels. Divide a pixel by the reported `scale`." = "坐标是显示「点」（x 向右，y 向下，主显示器左上角为原点），不是截图像素。像素值需除以返回的 `scale`。";
"Check the action list against docs/protocol.md. The whole batch is validated before anything is performed, so nothing was done." = "请对照 docs/protocol.md 检查操作列表。整批操作会先校验再执行，因此这次什么都没有发生。";
"No app is frontmost in the AgentSpace session, so the events would go nowhere. Launch or activate something there first, e.g. `agentspace launch <space> Finder`." = "AgentSpace 会话中没有前台应用，事件将无处投递。请先在那里启动或激活一个应用，例如 `agentspace launch <space> Finder`。";
"Pass an app name that exists in the AgentSpace session (`agentspace apps <space>`) or an absolute path to a .app bundle." = "传入 AgentSpace 会话中存在的应用名（`agentspace apps <space>`）或 .app 捆绑包的绝对路径。";
"The app was launched but never registered with the window server. It may be showing a modal in the AgentSpace session; take a screenshot to look." = "应用已启动但从未在窗口服务器注册。它可能在 AgentSpace 会话中弹出了模态窗口；可截图查看。";
"The app is not running in that Space. `agentspace apps <space>` lists what is." = "该应用没有在那个 Space 中运行。`agentspace apps <space>` 可列出正在运行的应用。";
"Check the repository path, the branch name (it must start with agentspace/) and the shared folder paths. The message names the specific problem." = "检查仓库路径、分支名（必须以 agentspace/ 开头）和共享文件夹路径。错误消息中会说明具体问题。";
"The path is outside this Space's workspace and shared folders. Add it in the Space's Shared Folders settings first." = "该路径在此 Space 的工作区和共享文件夹之外。请先在该 Space 的共享文件夹设置中添加它。";
"Raise the timeout or make the command shorter. The process group was terminated." = "调大超时或缩短命令。进程组已被终止。";
"That command is on AgentSpace's refusal list. Run it yourself in your own terminal if you really mean it." = "该命令在 AgentSpace 的拒绝清单上。如果确有需要，请在你自己的终端里运行。";
"The privileged helper is not installed. Creating and deleting Spaces needs it, because it makes a macOS user; driving an existing Space does not. Open the AgentSpace app and choose Install Helper." = "特权助手未安装。创建和删除 Space 需要它，因为那会创建 macOS 用户；驱动已有的 Space 不需要。打开 AgentSpace 应用并选择「安装助手」。";
"The privileged helper refused the request. Check the Space's name and account, and use Export Diagnostics in the app to collect the helper's log." = "特权助手拒绝了请求。请检查 Space 的名称与账号，并使用应用内的“导出诊断信息”收集 helper 日志。";
"The session token does not match this Space. Re-read it from the runtime directory, or recreate the Space." = "会话令牌与该 Space 不匹配。请从运行时目录重新读取，或重建该 Space。";
"Malformed request. See docs/protocol.md for the exact shape." = "请求格式错误。具体结构见 docs/protocol.md。";
